{"frozen_reasoning_spans":[{"end":151,"id":"S001","sha256":"c78e44c49bab519f329640173f11ef8c1e12fc3fc50e91f91736e836603d945f","start":0,"text":"To solve |x + 1| + |x - 6| = 23, we consider the critical points where the expressions inside the absolute values change signs, i.e., x = -1 and x = 6."},{"end":238,"id":"S002","sha256":"d040d8d1211c04f965f1c6bebdeb64b565a7b6d221068d85687ff9d21f3e7ceb","start":152,"text":"These points divide the real line into three intervals: (-\u221e, -1), [-1, 6], and (6, \u221e)."},{"end":289,"id":"S003","sha256":"3af26dc9791281366ac181fc7d50b2d2cbcf50dd35d6030f1c6fd295e3fc8ff8","start":239,"text":"We solve the equation in each interval separately."},{"end":344,"id":"S004","sha256":"2dfca57f406fbc612dcb8e4a0ecfa646157c8615d799c0a1686d060ca99cbcce","start":290,"text":"For x < -1, |x + 1| = -(x + 1) and |x - 6| = -(x - 6)."},{"end":430,"id":"S005","sha256":"5795d61d7b8a54e0acb42fefb4a0e2b3494b6bf31d93b58dfc8e5ee76b8ba2d5","start":345,"text":"Thus, the equation becomes -(x + 1) - (x - 6) = 23, which simplifies to -2x + 5 = 23."},{"end":458,"id":"S006","sha256":"1820c07e12aefccfd16b967a66ee55f222f267c0795df4a85cb145005cadceab","start":431,"text":"Solving for x gives x = -9."},{"end":514,"id":"S007","sha256":"6b8204eb21fad1b59719748e162f7e33f4f64e518bf7603e91554d0b57dc28f6","start":459,"text":"For -1 \u2264 x \u2264 6, |x + 1| = x + 1 and |x - 6| = -(x - 6)."},{"end":593,"id":"S008","sha256":"e89e9e07902b3f0214e30f6503438d8a18ba38e3c8fd5c10e06a28fd28381196","start":515,"text":"Thus, the equation becomes (x + 1) - (x - 6) = 23, which simplifies to 7 = 23."},{"end":662,"id":"S009","sha256":"dfabe04c6ac5ad2e78240f0460c0ffa89cb814fbb2fabb5db4a8db9b1d7fda69","start":594,"text":"This is a contradiction, so there are no solutions in this interval."},{"end":710,"id":"S010","sha256":"87de75efbb978736260b7adb4b16f13f456e2eb18d3b36cc0d29f2e452a49614","start":663,"text":"For x > 6, |x + 1| = x + 1 and |x - 6| = x - 6."},{"end":794,"id":"S011","sha256":"45dc9afe74702cb2b38898771dd6402c1a6defd947514ade46ae98f5bf5b157a","start":711,"text":"Thus, the equation becomes (x + 1) + (x - 6) = 23, which simplifies to 2x - 5 = 23."},{"end":822,"id":"S012","sha256":"7c18ee7ac18bc9456344c97ac8b81fd7f3f465bff85c99f56b118877e4758e8f","start":795,"text":"Solving for x gives x = 14."},{"end":870,"id":"S013","sha256":"54eb3950e934af448a4057ec611973ee8b1790158a375c2494c0fe76bbae4ff1","start":823,"text":"Therefore, the solutions are x = -9 and x = 14."},{"end":929,"id":"S014","sha256":"9d687996943630f5e14f4de66f61db53dc3715fe86dacfa5e00c785ad256de7e","start":871,"text":"The smallest value of x that satisfies the equation is -9."}],"problem":"Solve for all real values of x: |x + 1| + |x - 6| = 23. Report the smallest value of x that satisfies the equation.","problem_id":"cw1-3ed474a04b63","span_projection_version":"action-census-reasoning-span-projection-v1"}

